<title>RUSSIA: Rouble rises to 3,605 per mark in Moscow.</title>
<headline>Rouble rises to 3,605 per mark in Moscow.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The rouble rose to 3,605 to the German mark on the Moscow Interbank Currency Exchange from 3,639 on Friday.</p>
<p>					 Sept 9		  Sept 6</p>
<p> Mark rate			   3,605		   3,639</p>
<p> Volume traded (million DEM)    2.53		    2.09</p>
<p>-- Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
